From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:48:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make media sources read-only (Kodi way)

All FileEditor implementations now refuse delete, write, rename, move,
mkdir and touch outside the app private directories. MediaStore delete
and rename requests are refused too. A single SourceAccessPolicy decides
what is writable: only internal/external app files and cache dirs.

Nothing in the UI can delete or alter a video, a subtitle or anything
else living on SMB/FTP/SFTP/WebDAV/UPnP shares, SAF trees or local
media folders anymore, whatever code path asks for it.
